Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.54,0:01:42.72,op_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HF2FFE3&\3c&HA1D97F&}いつか 二人なら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.72,0:01:45.75,op_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFF9F9&\2c&HFBEAE8&\3c&HE2A6B4&}いつか 二人なら
